JWT Re-auth

Based on NCC Group's JWT Re-auth:
https://github.com/nccgroup/jwt-reauth
Copyright 2022 NCC Group
Original contributors: Sam Leonard and James Briggs (see CONTRIBUTORS.md).

This distribution is a modified fork maintained at:
https://github.com/soffensive/jwt-reauth

Changes in this fork (2026) include custom re-authentication HTTP templates,
response extraction, independent concurrent session profiles, a Sessions UI,
automated checks, and packaging of runtime dependencies and license notices.
